 * AI Teammate Token Usage Reporter (JSRunner)
 *
 * Downloads completed GitHub Actions logs for ai-teammate runs, extracts Copilot
 * token summaries printed by CommandLineUtils, and writes CSV/JSON/HTML outputs.
